B0476D1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "COVER MAD INSPECTOR.png", "id": "1072796288967590", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824671_1072796292300923_8763419037287287166_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=70KlVnCZKl4Q7kNvwGqN5Wy&_nc_oc=Adpteiz-qg4XuAmDELbpbJhAV93srCM1vkOsMDk2seZ2dituHszmsY0amDW4WSrKtCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTmeE6tryGbZX_WpHTpupUBH5vaLvXMuv350zM7fSckPQ&oe=6B045296"}, "display_name": "The Mad Inspector", "keywords": ["TheMadInspector", "Mad", "Inspector", "The", "Simulator"], "long_description": "Welcome to The Mad Inspector, a chaotic VR inspection game where every person could be hiding something unexpected!\n- Inspect suspicious characters and search them for hidden items.\n- Decide who gets approved and who gets rejected.\n- Confiscate illegal, valuable, strange, and hilarious objects.\n- Sell seized items and build up your cash.\n- Upgrade your headquarters with new equipment and areas.\n- Unlock weapons and prepare yourself for dangerous situations.\n- Hire bodyguards to protect you when things get out of control.\n- Customize your character with different clothes and styles.\n- Unlock new locations and expand your operation as you progress.\n- Watch your risk level rise as your actions attract more police attention.\n- Survive intense police raids, helicopters, armed units, and complete chaos.\n- Experience unpredictable characters, funny reactions, and ridiculous situations made for VR.\nSearch. Decide. Upgrade. Survive.\nHow long can you stay in control?", "short_description": "Step into the shoes of a street inspector in VR! Search suspicious characters, confiscate strange and illegal items, make tough decisions, earn money, upgrade your hideout, hire bodyguards, unlock weapons, and survive escalating police raids in a chaotic and hilarious world."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privac